<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>opensmarters — third-party licences</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #141013; color: #F4ECE4; max-width: 920px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  a { color: #E6BE91; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: 600; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #20191E; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .85rem; }
  .crates { color: #BFAFB6; font-size: .9rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>opensmarters is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. It includes the Rust crates listed below.
Bundled native components (libmpv/FFmpeg), fonts and icons are described in <code>THIRD_PARTY.md</code>.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p class="crates">Used by:
  {{#each used_by}}<a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}
  </p>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
